  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sitaram Khaitan & Anr vs The State Of Bihar on 14 May, 2015",
    "facts": "2. The present petition has been filed for quashing the order dated 16.06.2011 passed by the learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Katihar taking cognizance in connection with B III Case No.03 of 2011 for the offence under Sections 16 (1) (a) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 (in short, \"the Act\"). 3.",
    "arguments": "It is further submitted that there is nothing in the said report to indicate that the colouring matter or any other ingredients was found to be of a nature injurious to health or otherwise unfit for human consumption.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "It is further submitted that there is nothing in the said report to indicate that the colouring matter or any other ingredients was found to be of a nature injurious to health or otherwise unfit for human consumption.",
